{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6864efa2231539431c6231561cb8aab638d27b9ef424c3a848bc09d1c9345418", "ja": "そうか……そうだよな……。", "zh": "这样啊……说得也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0084_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "4363441eddfe56b37c04f4d2bbfd7c8ac1fdaf5dc781ec468b69f42743c85df6", "ja": "あの……{$P$}は、\nこの衣装、どう思いますか？", "zh": "请问……{$P$}，\n你对这套服装怎么看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "241c6d11fc976f594cec6177e7adf459d852535e0fa36e7e5f8bdf64084915d5", "ja": "そうだな。月並みな言葉だけど、似合うと思う。\n紗代子の活動的なイメージにピッタリだ。", "zh": "这个嘛，虽然你可能听多了，但很适合你。\n我觉得这很符合纱代子活泼的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0084_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "067f9950d76121badcc8e05b4a32d1410180d85806e19be9e26b372d69d570b4", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nそう言ってもらえて、すこし安心しました。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n听到你这么说，我稍微放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
